  "hub.faqA2": "Open your school from the Schools page, go to the Users tab, and click \"Add User\". Enter their email, name, and role.",
  "hub.faqQ3": "How do I create classes?",
  "hub.faqA3": "First create Grades under your school, then create Academic Years, and finally create Classes linked to a grade and academic year.",
  "hub.faqQ4": "How do I manage invoices?",
  "hub.faqA4": "Go to Invoices from the sidebar. You can create, edit, and download invoices as PDF from there.",
  "hub.faqQ5": "How do I upgrade my plan?",
  "hub.faqA5": "Go to Subscription from the sidebar, choose your plan, and complete the Stripe checkout.",
